      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "1. Valid and Invalid TCP/IP Packets:\n   - Test inbound valid TCP/IP packets; ensure successful delivery and ensure data is correctly interpreted (score: 2).\n   - Test inbound invalid TCP/IP packets; verify the system identifies and blocks them (score: 2).\n\n2. UDP Inbound and Outbound Traffic:\n   - Test proper handling of both valid and invalid UDP traffic (score: 2).\n   - Assess reliability of UDP data transmission (score: 2).\n\n3. Signature Detectors:\n   - Check detection of known malformed packet signatures (score: 3).\n\n4. Rule Updates:\n   - Test automated rule updates transmission over an encrypted tunnel (score: 2).\n   - Verify that the system correctly implements new rules without conflicts (score: 2).\n\n5. User Interface Testing:\n   - Test the admin dashboard's performance, usability, and correct identification of admin privileges (score: 3).\n\n6. Rule Management:\n   - Test creation, modification, and removal of firewall rules from the dashboard (score: 3).\n\nThis makes for a total score of 19. These are relatively simple tests addressing the presented specs; deeper or more advanced tests can be added. Consider automating some of these base",
